{"id":"qt-design-studio","name":"Qt Design Studio","tagline":"UI Designer for Qml applications","blurb":"Define the look and feel of the UI from wireframe to final implementation with preset UI components.","description":"Define the look and feel of the UI from wireframe to final implementation\nwith preset UI components. Import UI design files from 2D and 3D tools\nto Qt Design Studio, which can turn them into code for developers.\n\nQt Design Studio prototyping features bring your designs to life and\nsimulate and validate interactions and dynamic behavior.\n\nYou can test, preview, and fine-tune your designs to pixel-perfection live\non the desktop or target device.","developer":"Qt Project","icon":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/qt/qtdesignstudio/a2251e3e17cb587ff03865ad984b5251/icons/128x128/io.qt.qtdesignstudio.png","screenshots":[{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/qt/qtdesignstudio/a2251e3e17cb587ff03865ad984b5251/screenshots/image-1_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/qt/qtdesignstudio/a2251e3e17cb587ff03865ad984b5251/screenshots/image-1_1248x873@1.png","w":1566,"h":1096},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/qt/qtdesignstudio/a2251e3e17cb587ff03865ad984b5251/screenshots/image-2_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/qt/qtdesignstudio/a2251e3e17cb587ff03865ad984b5251/screenshots/image-2_1248x841@1.png","w":3132,"h":2111},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/qt/qtdesignstudio/a2251e3e17cb587ff03865ad984b5251/screenshots/image-3_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/qt/qtdesignstudio/a2251e3e17cb587ff03865ad984b5251/screenshots/image-3_1248x720@1.png","w":3835,"h":2215},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/qt/qtdesignstudio/a2251e3e17cb587ff03865ad984b5251/screenshots/image-4_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/qt/qtdesignstudio/a2251e3e17cb587ff03865ad984b5251/screenshots/image-4_1248x739@1.png","w":1876,"h":1111}],"categories":["Graphics & Design","Developer Tools"],"tags":["development